  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Room for One More",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>If a PC marks their last HP while in the graveyard, they become a Specter instead of making a death move. While a Specter, a PC can communicate with the living but can't interact with the physical world, and they must stay within Close range of their corpse or cross through the veil of death. This condition is cleared when the PC clears a HP.</p><section id=\"secret-qGN79en8zBOIKQe2\" class=\"secret\"><p>What new information or experience does a PC gain from becoming a specter? How can the party reunite the PC's spirit with their flesh? What happens if their ritual goes wrong?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
        "actions": {},
        "granter": null
      },
      "_id": "jAe6q70mR0ujYqnD",
      "img": "icons/magic/death/undead-ghost-scream-teal.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
