    {
      "name": "Hallowed Ground",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>At the center of the graveyard is a seemingly undisturbed chapel. On a successful Instinct Roll, a PC can discover this structure is sanctified against the cemetery's denizens. While inside the chapel, the PCs have advantage on action rolls to fight or drive off spirits and undead.</p><section id=\"secret-8lcytZzx1FbzPrVx\" class=\"secret\"><p>Who sanctified this place, and what happened to them? What holy relics can be found here?</p></section>",
